  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. New io_primitives/kotlin.yaml with Kotlin stdlib (kotlin.io File/Path extensions + top-level println), ktor client/server, Android Log, kotlin-logging (both mu.KLogger and 5.x io.github.oshai variant), Exposed ORM. Moved kotlin from _CATALOG_ALIASES to _CATALOG_PARENTS so Java parent still covers raw java.io/java.net/JDBC. 3 new tests cover Java-parent merge, boundary-kind breadth, and the alias→parent regression guard."  # 9874
